<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 101 0 R
/T (Our shutters are motorized and remote-controlled, and can be either hardwired or plugged into a standard 120V outlet. Depending on the material, they may be insulated or non-insulated, though all feature a powder-coat finish. The insulation improves energy efficiency, and the shutters are ideal for storm protection, security, and wind and noise reduction. They are equipped with a motor, remote controls, bumper sensors, manual overrides, and one override crank handle for manual operation during power outages. If safety sensors are not required, they can be omitted.)
/E (Our shutters are motorized and remote-controlled, and can be either hardwired or plugged into a standard 120V outlet. Depending on the material, they may be insulated or non-insulated, though all feature a powder-coat finish. The insulation improves energy efficiency, and the shutters are ideal for storm protection, security, and wind and noise reduction. They are equipped with a motor, remote controls, bumper sensors, manual overrides, and one override crank handle for manual operation during power outages. If safety sensors are not required, they can be omitted.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
