/Title (Our motorized exterior shades are made with Fiberglass Mermet Natte Fabric, available in 3%, 5%, and 10% openness, plus blackout and bug-screen options. The TMAX system features powder-coated hardware. These shades can be hardwired or plugged into an outlet. Key features include: - 10-year fabric warranty - 5-year motor warranty - 2-year system warranty All systems come with remotes that allow control of multiple shades on separate or the same channels. For added convenience, we offer a WiFi Hub for an extra fee, which enables remote control, timer settings, and compatibility with Alexa and Google via a smartphone app.)
